@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Health Check Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### User Registration Endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "matheus",
    "email": "matheus@teste.com.br",
    "password": "super123456"
}

### User Token Generation Endpoint
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=matheus@teste.com.br&password=super123456

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Get User Profile Endpoint (requires JWT token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Select Plan Endpoint (requires JWT token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/select-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "plan_id": 3,
    "credit_card": "23456789"
}

### GET user plans (requires JWT token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a bank account (requires JWT token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movements/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Conta teste 4",
    "bank_name": "Itau",
    "account_number": "123456",
    "account_type": "Corrente",
    "initial_balance": 1000.0
}